{"1897770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Majestic", "steam_appid": 1897770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/7d70d9a39ab5704e671831ba61f783dd.webp?t=1786024951\" width=368 height=49 /></span><br><strong>An Epic  Story in a Beautiful Immersive World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/8c8eeade788822d99d5c5a8d891b4192.webp?t=1786024951\" width=368 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the world through the eyes of an eagle.<strong> <i>The Majestic</i></strong> is a casual story-driven experience. Explore at your own pace, soak in the world, and let the story find you. Soar at your own pace across lush forests, shimmering lagoons, ancient ruins, bustling cities, and floating mountain ranges. Along the way, discover Moments in Time that reveal the joys, heartbreaks, and enduring bonds of a family across generations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/e137500f6b2f1989f4d3d3094e5d677b.poster.avif?t=1786024951\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/e137500f6b2f1989f4d3d3094e5d677b.webm?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/e137500f6b2f1989f4d3d3094e5d677b.mp4?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/1db09d35fdf955ce8b29f02a44994e44.poster.avif?t=1786024951\" width=300 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/1db09d35fdf955ce8b29f02a44994e44.webm?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/1db09d35fdf955ce8b29f02a44994e44.mp4?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soar freely across a vast open world</strong> of forests, lagoons, ancient ruins, bustling cities, and floating mountain ranges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain power and abilities</strong> by completing optional objectives and challenges throughout the world. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over four hours of handcrafted cinematic storytelling</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relive pivotal Moments in Time</strong>, story vignettes that illuminate the characters and deepen the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No death, no pressure</strong>, a welcoming pace for players who want to explore, immerse themselves, and feel something. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original cinematic soundtrack</strong> woven through every scene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full human voice acting</strong> throughout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/d92767ff83263e27dd214c340ce8a4e0.poster.avif?t=1786024951\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/d92767ff83263e27dd214c340ce8a4e0.webm?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/d92767ff83263e27dd214c340ce8a4e0.mp4?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/7d70d9a39ab5704e671831ba61f783dd.webp?t=1786024951\" width=368 height=49 /></span><br><strong>Deeply Emotional Story of Family, Love and Hope</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/8c8eeade788822d99d5c5a8d891b4192.webp?t=1786024951\" width=368 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two sisters have spent years drifting apart. One cannot let go of the past. The other has spent a lifetime trying to step out from her sister's shadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Jess has never recovered from losing her twin brother, Cody. His presence lingers beside her as a wolf companion, a shadow she can't explain and that nobody else believes in. Slowly, quietly, she has withdrawn from everyone she loves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daisy has spent years trying to reach her sister. Eventually, she stops waiting for Jess to return and begins forging a life of her own, joining a guild, rising through its ranks, and proving herself on her own terms. Yet the distance between them never stops hurting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/d831b282c2a429d3f1d778a99ce7201e.poster.avif?t=1786024951\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/d831b282c2a429d3f1d778a99ce7201e.webm?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/d831b282c2a429d3f1d778a99ce7201e.mp4?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/7d70d9a39ab5704e671831ba61f783dd.webp?t=1786024951\" width=368 height=49 /></span><strong><br>Vanquish the Dark </strong>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/8c8eeade788822d99d5c5a8d891b4192.webp?t=1786024951\" width=368 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Darkness spreads across the land, the sisters are drawn toward a destiny neither chose. What follows is an intimate story of grief, hope, forgiveness, and  family, culminating in a battle against a force that threatens everything they hold dear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/84985f4a2caa94cb0b6b281aebc6849e.poster.avif?t=1786024951\" width=480 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/84985f4a2caa94cb0b6b281aebc6849e.webm?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1897770/extras/84985f4a2caa94cb0b6b281aebc6849e.mp4?t=1786024951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br>  </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img